# An allowlist: everything is withheld from the build context except what the
# Dockerfile names. A new file in the repository, a secret included, can never be
# swept into the context or a layer by accident. Add a line here with every new COPY.
*
!src/
!pyproject.toml
!uv.lock
!README.md

# Byte-code a local run may leave inside src/.
**/__pycache__/
**/*.py[cod]
